 after resolving a local variable of the removed test or a constant of the class to its initializer, or equal after the implicit conversions of JUnit from a string, to an enum constant by its name, i.e., Action.CREATE for CREATE, and with a single-argument constructor, i.e., new File(\"x\") for x.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"pyro-ppl/numpyro","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-04T23:28:05Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"ca7b656f2ed8c2724525728787f661321cf7d13f","github_link":"https://github.com/pyro-ppl/numpyro/commit/ca7b656f2ed8c2724525728787f661321cf7d13f","commit_subject":"docs: update development setup for uv dependency groups (#2287)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"yvanvds/yse-soundengine","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-04T23:27:31Z","branch":"dev","commit_sha":"8ee1347c531d708c3e729c799ed1e98c477a287e","github_link":"https://github.com/yvanvds/yse-soundengine/commit/8ee1347c531d708c3e729c799ed1e98c477a287e","commit_subject":"ci: resize the Android and Sanitizers timeout caps per the #621 rule (#1273)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"pipeshub-ai/pipeshub-ai","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-04T23:27:16Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"be598c7dac47627b3eb2ebcf50adf9cc22cebaea","github_link":"https://github.com/pipeshub-ai/pipeshub-ai/commit/be598c7dac47627b3eb2ebcf50adf9cc22cebaea","commit_subject":"test: give the source-tree lints a timeout that a loaded runner fits in (#5374)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"trpc/trpc","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-04T23:27:11Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"33ee2ba5880d7db5115bcea400e9749c417610e8","github_link":"https://github.com/trpc/trpc/commit/33ee2ba5880d7db5115bcea400e9749c417610e8","commit_subject":"fix(server): keep a throwing onError, errorFormatter or encoder from crashing the ws server (#7915)","ai_tool":"Cursor"},{"repo_name":"microsoft/aspire","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-04T23:27:05Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"eef8a45871db9ad8fcbb153451001a3819a81aca","github_link":"https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/commit/